# defaults.list — the curated default web apps for `iictl webapp seed`.
#
# OPT-IN ONLY: nothing here is installed automatically. The distro ships zero
# web-app launchers by default; `iictl webapp seed` reads this file and runs
# `iictl webapp add` for each line (idempotently — already-present launchers are
# skipped). Each becomes a user-owned ~/.local/share/applications/ii-webapp-
# <slug>.desktop running brave-bin in --app mode, fully reversible via
# `iictl webapp remove <name>` / `iictl revert-all`.
#
# Format, one per line:   <name>|<url>[|<icon-path>]
#   name  — display name; the slug is derived (lowercase, [a-z0-9-]).
#   url   — the web app URL (https://…).
#   icon  — OPTIONAL absolute path to a local icon; omitted → best-effort favicon
#           fetch, then the generic baked fallback.png.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored. Text-only — NO PII.

YouTube|https://youtube.com
Proton Mail|https://mail.proton.me
Google Maps|https://maps.google.com
ChatGPT|https://chat.openai.com
WhatsApp Web|https://web.whatsapp.com
